# AmeOS desktop package manifest
#
# This is an explicit install plan for a prepared FreeBSD desktop system.
# It is intentionally not consumed by build-release.sh yet: release builds
# remain offline and do not resolve package names from the network.

# Wayland compositor and session
wayfire
wayland
libxkbcommon

# Rendering and X11 compatibility
mesa-libs
xwayland
libdrm

# Terminal and fonts
foot
dejavu
liberation-fonts-ttf

# Optional desktop helpers
# wf-shell
# waybar
